{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39062","headline":"哭方玄英先生 · 孙合","name":"哭方玄英先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛斗文星落，知是先生死。\n湖上闻哭声，门前见弹指。\n官无一寸禄，名传千万里。\n死着弊衣裳，生谁顾朱紫。\n我心痛其语，泪落不能已。\n犹喜韦补阙，扬名荐天子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}